    "body": "`git_branch` *is* listed in this file, as well as `fossil_branch` and `hg_branch`, all using `` (nf-oct-git_branch), which is a bit visually different from the default powerline symbol `` (nf-pl-branch).\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/starship/starship/assets/4580066/3b9c3a9c-26cb-4948-ab84-8089e652a8df)\r\n\r\nI guess the author of the original config simply liked `nf-oct-git_branch` more. IMO it looks a bit better, but perhaps it's not worth the divergence from the original.",
